{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2022-12-05 08:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE SETS THE DATE FOR ITS SECOND QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2023 EARNINGS ANNOUNCEMENT', 'text': 'EARNINGS RESULTS TO BE RELEASED ON DECEMBER 12, 2022, AFTER THE CLOSE OF THE MARKET AUSTIN, TEXAS , DEC. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ORACLE CORPORATION TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SECOND QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2023 RESULTS WILL BE RELEASED ON MONDAY, DECEMBER 12TH, AFTER THE CLOSE OF THE MARKET.\xa0 ORACLE WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL AND LIVE WEBCAST AT 4:00 P.M.'}